      "content": "wait butter?? i thought i heard somewhere that butter is good for burns because it coats it. won't the oil in the butter help keep the moisture in so the skin doesn't dry out and crack? i'm really worried about it hurting more if i just leave it exposed. isn't it better to cover it with something thick like that?",
